    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, I think I've got the sequence down. Could you explain the specific consequences of having *too much* angiotensin II in the system? Like, what are the physiological effects if this pathway becomes hyperactive or unregulated? I'm trying to visualize how the body reacts when those vasoconstrictors are running wild.",
